The SysML v2 standard library
=============================

The files under `library/` are the KerML and SysML v2 standard model
libraries, taken verbatim from the OMG SysML v2 Release repository:

    https://github.com/Systems-Modeling/SysML-v2-Release
    release 2026-05, commit de1070ae8e79c21532b8004fc663d47b35d0e9fa

They are maintained by the Reference Implementation Working Group of the
OMG Systems Modeling Community, and are licensed under the Eclipse Public
License 2.0. The licence text is in `LICENSE` beside this file, and is
the licence of this crate.

Nothing in `library/` was written here and nothing in it was changed. The
rest of sysml-v2-rs is licensed under MIT or Apache-2.0, at your option;
this crate is separate from it so that which files are under which
licence is a question with a one-word answer.

